    <item>
      <title>Որո՞ւն հարստութեան վրայ կառուցուեցաւ Թուրքիոյ Հանրապետութիւնը</title>
      <link>https://westernarmeniatv.com/history_wa/%d5%b8%d6%80%d5%b8%d5%9e%d6%82%d5%b6-%d5%b0%d5%a1%d6%80%d5%bd%d5%bf%d5%b8%d6%82%d5%a9%d5%a5%d5%a1%d5%b6-%d5%be%d6%80%d5%a1%d5%b5-%d5%af%d5%a1%d5%bc%d5%b8%d6%82%d6%81%d5%b8%d6%82%d5%a5%d6%81%d5%a1/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25d5%25b8%25d6%2580%25d5%25b8%25d5%259e%25d6%2582%25d5%25b6-%25d5%25b0%25d5%25a1%25d6%2580%25d5%25bd%25d5%25bf%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d5%25a9%25d5%25a5%25d5%25a1%25d5%25b6-%25d5%25be%25d6%2580%25d5%25a1%25d5%25b5-%25d5%25af%25d5%25a1%25d5%25bc%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d6%2581%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d5%25a5%25d6%2581%25d5%25a1</link>
      <description>Թուրք տնտեսագէտ Ումիթ Իզմէն, անդրադառնալով Capital in the Twenty-First Century աշխատութեան, շարք մը հիմնարար հարցեր կը բարձրացնէ Թուրքիոյ մէջ կապիտալի The post Որո՞ւն հարստութեան վրայ կառուցուեցաւ Թուրքիոյ Հանրապետութիւնը first appeared on Western Armenia TV.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://westernarmeniatv.com/history_wa/%d5%b8%d6%80%d5%b8%d5%9e%d6%82%d5%b6-%d5%b0%d5%a1%d6%80%d5%bd%d5%bf%d5%b8%d6%82%d5%a9%d5%a5%d5%a1%d5%b6-%d5%be%d6%80%d5%a1%d5%b5-%d5%af%d5%a1%d5%bc%d5%b8%d6%82%d6%81%d5%b8%d6%82%d5%a5%d6%81%d5%a1/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25d5%25b8%25d6%2580%25d5%25b8%25d5%259e%25d6%2582%25d5%25b6-%25d5%25b0%25d5%25a1%25d6%2580%25d5%25bd%25d5%25bf%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d5%25a9%25d5%25a5%25d5%25a1%25d5%25b6-%25d5%25be%25d6%2580%25d5%25a1%25d5%25b5-%25d5%25af%25d5%25a1%25d5%25bc%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d6%2581%25d5%25b8%25d6%2582%25d5%25a5%25d6%2581%25d5%25a1</guid>
